Queue the settled preview refresh after the pool resync. The normal `RemovalEffect::Dropped` path does this because skim does not refresh the preview when the selected last row disappears; this new background drop has the same case.

```suggestion
                        let _ = tx.try_send(Event::Action(resync_pool_action(Arc::clone(&items))));
                        let _ = tx.try_send(Event::Action(run_preview_when_settled(
                            Arc::new(AtomicUsize::new(0)),
                            Arc::new(AtomicUsize::new(0)),
                        )));
```
